 "storyArc": "Tomás's new life starts at five: shower (cold), bakery, café, accounts, chess with Hernando, bed. But every Thursday at eight he locks himself in the storeroom: he is still doing video interviews for a job in Toronto. One Thursday Vale opens the door while he is saying, in English, \"I'm only here for a few months\". She closes it again without a word."
